  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おんこうだが　おこらせると　どくがしみこんだ　するどい　まえばでかみつき　しびれさせてくるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "온화하지만 화가 나게 하면 독이 밴 날카로운 앞니로 물어서 상대를 마비시킨다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "雖然性情溫馴，但一旦被激怒，就會用滲入了毒素的尖銳門牙過來咬住你，讓你全身麻痺不已。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon est d’un naturel doux, mais lorsqu’il se met en colère, il mord à l’aide de ses incisives acérées et imprégnées de venin paralysant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Wer dieses friedfertige Pokémon verärgert, wird durch einen Biss mit seinen scharfen, giftgetränkten Schneidezähnen gelähmt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es manso, pero muerde y paraliza a quien lo enfada con sus afilados incisivos impregnados de toxinas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È di natura mite, ma se qualcuno lo fa arrabbiare lo morde con gli incisivi impregnati di un veleno paralizzante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Though usually a mellow Pokémon, it will sink its sharp, poison-soaked front teeth into any that anger it, causing paralysis in the object of its ire.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "温厚だが　怒らせると　毒が染みこんだ　鋭い　前歯で咬みつき　痺れさせてくるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "虽然性格温和，但一旦被谁激怒，就会用渗入了毒的锋利门牙咬住对方，使其全身麻痹。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es manso, pero muerde y paraliza a quien lo enfada con sus afilados incisivos impregnados de toxinas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "なわばりに　てきが　ちかづかないようしげきしゅうがする　どくえきですの　まわりに　ずけいを　えがく。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "영역에 적이 접근하지 못하게 자극적인 냄새가 나는 독액으로 보금자리 주변에 도형을 그린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "為了不讓敵人靠近地盤，會用有刺鼻臭味的毒液，在巢的周圍描繪圖形。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Afin de maintenir ses adversaires hors de son territoire, il dessine des symboles autour de son nid à l’aide d’une toxine à l’odeur irritante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Um Feinde von seinem Revier fernzuhalten, malt es mit einer giftigen, stechend riechenden Flüssigkeit Markierungen um sein Nest herum.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Pinta marcas alrededor de su nido con un líquido venenoso de fuerte olor acre para mantener a los enemigos alejados de su territorio.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Per evitare che i nemici si avvicinino al suo territorio, disegna figure intorno alla tana con un liquido velenoso dall’odore pungente.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "To keep enemies away from its territory, it paints markings around its nest using a poisonous liquid that has an acrid odor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "縄張りに　敵が　近づかないよう刺激臭がする　毒液で巣の　まわりに　図形を　描く。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "为了不让敌人靠近地盘，会用带着刺鼻臭味的毒液在巢的周围画出图形。",
      "language": {
